WEBVTT

00:00:03.230 --> 00:00:05.560
Your daughter's name is Yujin Jung, correct?

00:00:05.690 --> 00:00:06.400
Yes.

00:00:09.070 --> 00:00:12.360
Have you heard of the name Joonsang Kang before?

00:00:16.870 --> 00:00:18.950
Joonsang is my son.

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:29.290
Please recite your vows.

00:00:30.670 --> 00:00:33.130
I, Peter Kim, take you, Regina Han, to be my wife.

00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:36.390
As God is my witness, I will love and honor you all the days of my life.

00:00:37.590 --> 00:00:39.890
I, Regina Han, take you, Peter Kim, to be my husband.

00:00:39.890 --> 00:00:42.890
As God is my witness, I will love and honor you all the days of my life.

00:00:44.230 --> 00:00:47.600
You have now declared your consent before the Church.

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:50.820
Do you know them?

00:00:51.980 --> 00:00:52.900
Who are they?

00:00:53.300 --> 00:00:54.070
No clue.

00:02:35.050 --> 00:02:36.260
Will you be heading home?

00:02:36.840 --> 00:02:38.800
No, let's go back to Seoul.

00:02:39.880 --> 00:02:41.970
I thought you wanted to stay here in Chuncheon for a few days?

00:02:42.470 --> 00:02:45.650
I want to concentrate on preparing for the concert,

00:02:45.650 --> 00:02:47.640
so don't schedule anything else for the time being.

00:02:56.270 --> 00:02:58.620
This same number's been calling you over and over for a while now;

00:02:58.620 --> 00:02:59.950
I think it might be urgent.

00:03:01.950 --> 00:03:02.910
Hello?

00:03:05.910 --> 00:03:08.410
Why are you calling me all of a sudden?

00:03:09.250 --> 00:03:12.620
<i>Why didn't you tell me that Joonsang was your son?</i>

00:03:13.920 --> 00:03:15.380
I had my reasons.

00:03:15.920 --> 00:03:19.420
Anyway, it's none of your concern.

00:03:19.920 --> 00:03:24.220
<i>Was it because he's my son?</i>

00:03:25.850 --> 00:03:28.520
W-What are you insinuating?

00:03:29.680 --> 00:03:32.990
Is he my son?

00:03:32.990 --> 00:03:33.770
Is that why?

00:03:34.520 --> 00:03:35.500
<i>No.</i>

00:03:35.500 --> 00:03:36.770
<i>He's got nothing to do with you.</i>

00:03:37.070 --> 00:03:39.360
Then whose son is he?

00:03:39.900 --> 00:03:40.780
Who's his father?

00:03:41.780 --> 00:03:43.490
<i>That's none of your business.</i>

00:03:44.780 --> 00:03:47.530
<i>Please don't bother me with ridiculous questions like this anymore.</i>

00:04:01.260 --> 00:04:03.430
What are you praying for, Yujin?

00:04:04.760 --> 00:04:06.090
It's a prayer of thanks.

00:04:06.550 --> 00:04:08.430
Of thanks?

00:04:09.310 --> 00:04:12.180
I'm thanking God for letting me be together with you

00:04:12.980 --> 00:04:14.730
like this right now.

00:04:17.360 --> 00:04:18.440
You pray too.

00:04:21.570 --> 00:04:22.570
Go on.

00:04:26.410 --> 00:04:28.990
Come on Joonsang, close your eyes.

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:34.830
Hurry up and pray, will you?

00:04:35.370 --> 00:04:37.000
I'm praying silently.

00:04:39.880 --> 00:04:42.170
I love a woman.

00:04:43.050 --> 00:04:47.390
I would like to live with this woman until I become a white-haired old man.

00:04:48.740 --> 00:04:53.480
I want to become a father, and have children who have her eyes.

00:04:54.680 --> 00:04:57.020
I want to become like a warm hand

00:04:58.690 --> 00:05:00.820
and strong feet

00:05:02.190 --> 00:05:04.570
to my loving wife and children.

00:05:06.860 --> 00:05:09.030
I want to become like a nurturing home

00:05:10.330 --> 00:05:12.410
to my loving wife and children.

00:05:13.200 --> 00:05:14.920
<i>He said that a loving heart</i>

00:05:14.920 --> 00:05:17.250
<i>is the best home that two loving people could have.</i>

00:05:20.630 --> 00:05:23.000
Even if the rooms are small,

00:05:23.000 --> 00:05:25.220
and the roof is crooked,

00:05:26.880 --> 00:05:28.220
I want them to always be able to come home to me.

00:05:28.890 --> 00:05:32.900
<i>"I want to become a house that someone can always come home to."</i>

00:05:44.030 --> 00:05:45.280
I love you.

00:06:27.070 --> 00:06:29.730
Well, if it isn't my good friend Sanghyuk.

00:06:29.730 --> 00:06:30.640
Welcome!

00:06:32.620 --> 00:06:33.620
Are you drunk?

00:06:34.370 --> 00:06:37.580
I'm trying to get there, but it's not happening.

00:06:40.120 --> 00:06:41.790
Could I get one more bottle of the same?

00:06:42.400 --> 00:06:42.910
Coming right up.

00:06:42.940 --> 00:06:44.150
You're drunk.

00:06:48.130 --> 00:06:50.840
I heard you met up with Yujin?

00:06:53.470 --> 00:06:54.800
I guess it didn't go well between you two, then.

00:07:04.810 --> 00:07:05.820
Joonsang's...

00:07:06.150 --> 00:07:07.320
Don't call him that!

00:07:07.440 --> 00:07:10.000
Mr. Minhyung is Joonsang.

00:07:10.000 --> 00:07:10.990
He was just suffering from amnesia because of the accident—

00:07:11.150 --> 00:07:11.910
I...

00:07:14.160 --> 00:07:15.410
I knew the whole time.

00:07:16.950 --> 00:07:18.370
I really hate Joonsang.

00:07:18.500 --> 00:07:23.080
Why is it that everyone's always looking for Joonsang, and not Minhyung?

00:07:23.580 --> 00:07:25.290
Even Minhyung was looking for him.

00:07:38.100 --> 00:07:38.850
Stop drinking.

00:07:40.980 --> 00:07:42.100
Please stop.

00:07:44.520 --> 00:07:47.400
You want to go out with me, Sanghyuk?

00:07:48.610 --> 00:07:51.530
Why don't two hurt people try to console one another?

00:07:51.950 --> 00:07:53.200
Let's get out of here.

00:07:53.200 --> 00:07:54.490
I'll take you home.

00:07:55.530 --> 00:07:56.880
You too, huh?

00:07:56.880 --> 00:07:58.160
You don't like me either?

00:07:58.490 --> 00:07:59.410
I know it's hard, Chelin,

00:07:59.700 --> 00:08:02.160
but don't act like this.

00:08:02.680 --> 00:08:04.210
So you don't like me, huh.

00:08:05.580 --> 00:08:07.880
It's because I'm not Yujin, isn't it?

00:08:13.720 --> 00:08:14.590
Are you all right?

00:08:14.970 --> 00:08:15.890
Leave me alone!

00:08:16.970 --> 00:08:19.500
Why is it that everyone's so in love with Yujin?!

00:08:19.500 --> 00:08:20.850
What's she got that I don't have?

00:08:20.970 --> 00:08:23.430
You, Joonsang, and Minhyung were all...

00:08:24.230 --> 00:08:26.730
Why doesn't anyone like me?

00:08:27.400 --> 00:08:31.320
Do you think only Yujin had Joonsang as her first love?

00:08:31.860 --> 00:08:34.000
He was my first love too.

00:08:34.000 --> 00:08:35.490
My first love!

00:08:41.700 --> 00:08:42.990
It's all right.

00:08:42.990 --> 00:08:44.500
It's going to get better.

00:08:45.500 --> 00:08:47.130
It'll all be better soon.

00:09:06.890 --> 00:09:08.600
Sanghyuk dropped by.

00:09:11.150 --> 00:09:13.440
He said he'd let me go,

00:09:13.780 --> 00:09:16.610
and that he didn't want me to lose you ever again.

00:09:18.450 --> 00:09:21.280
I'm a really bad person, aren't I?

00:09:22.540 --> 00:09:26.790
We share a special bond with Sanghyuk, don't we?

00:09:28.080 --> 00:09:30.400
Our parents were good friends with his,

00:09:30.400 --> 00:09:31.250
and we're...

00:09:33.340 --> 00:09:34.550
Mom.

00:09:40.720 --> 00:09:42.000
Listen to me.

00:09:42.000 --> 00:09:43.390
Don't see him anymore.

00:09:43.640 --> 00:09:46.730
I know that you're disappointed about Sanghyuk,

00:09:46.810 --> 00:09:49.400
but it just has to be Joonsang, Mom.

00:09:51.480 --> 00:09:52.520
Come on, Mom.

00:10:13.090 --> 00:10:16.260
Have we met before?

00:10:17.220 --> 00:10:19.550
I've had that feeling too.

00:10:21.140 --> 00:10:23.850
Before your father married me,

00:10:24.350 --> 00:10:26.580
they had been friends for a long time

00:10:26.580 --> 00:10:28.060
and were even engaged to one another.

00:10:28.480 --> 00:10:30.560
<i>The woman on Daddy's right is pretty, isn't she?</i>

00:10:30.690 --> 00:10:33.860
<i>The fact that they've linked arms is kind of suspicious, isn't it?</i>

00:10:34.230 --> 00:10:36.860
<i>Maybe he used to go out with her before marrying my mom.</i>

00:10:38.360 --> 00:10:39.950
You have no idea how much pain and suffering

00:10:40.280 --> 00:10:44.030
her infatuation caused the two of us.

00:10:44.450 --> 00:10:47.870
We eventually broke ties with her after she tried to commit suicide, but...

00:10:48.620 --> 00:10:51.120
She tried to commit suicide?

00:11:34.130 --> 00:11:35.330
Mi Hee, no!

00:11:57.650 --> 00:11:58.770
Hyeonsoo...

00:12:04.360 --> 00:12:05.070
Hyeonsoo!

00:12:05.360 --> 00:12:06.410
Hyeonsoo...

00:12:14.170 --> 00:12:15.120
Hyeonsoo!

00:12:15.750 --> 00:12:16.920
Hyeonsoo...

00:12:21.210 --> 00:12:22.700
Our relationship is like broken glass;

00:12:22.700 --> 00:12:26.300
there's nothing left for it to do now but shatter.

00:12:43.530 --> 00:12:46.820
The sins I've committed against Ms. Mi Hee are too great to count.

00:12:47.490 --> 00:12:51.040
If she says that you two shouldn't be together, I don't dare gainsay her.

00:12:51.200 --> 00:12:52.100
Mom...

00:12:53.160 --> 00:12:55.400
Can you imagine how much pain she must have suffered

00:12:55.400 --> 00:12:57.830
for her to try to take her own life?

00:12:58.880 --> 00:13:02.670
She even left this town, saying she'd curse us for the rest of her life.

00:13:03.880 --> 00:13:04.840
Yujin,

00:13:05.170 --> 00:13:08.010
I can't let you see Joonsang.

00:13:08.520 --> 00:13:10.550
You two can't see each other.

00:14:18.910 --> 00:14:23.380
Do you know how not to feel lonely in the Kingdom of Shadows?

00:14:25.080 --> 00:14:28.340
You just need to have someone remember your shadow.

00:14:29.170 --> 00:14:29.880
Like this.

00:15:03.710 --> 00:15:06.800
Most of the snow's melted here, hasn't it?

00:15:08.010 --> 00:15:09.300
Yeah.

00:15:09.300 --> 00:15:10.260
Does it make you sad?

00:15:10.260 --> 00:15:10.990
Yeah.

00:15:11.590 --> 00:15:14.230
The snow also melted quickly and spring came early

00:15:14.230 --> 00:15:16.350
that winter when I thought you were dead.

00:15:16.810 --> 00:15:18.280
I sometimes feel uneasy,

00:15:18.280 --> 00:15:21.350
thinking everything might fade away after winter goes away.

00:15:21.730 --> 00:15:23.450
That won't happen;

00:15:23.450 --> 00:15:24.730
I won't fade away.

00:15:25.770 --> 00:15:27.150
Promise?

00:15:27.270 --> 00:15:28.480
I promise.

00:15:31.150 --> 00:15:33.820
Did something happen yesterday, Yujin?

00:15:34.990 --> 00:15:36.500
Tell me if something's bugging you;

00:15:36.500 --> 00:15:37.740
I'll listen.

00:15:37.830 --> 00:15:38.990
It's nothing.

00:15:43.830 --> 00:15:45.550
I saw this thing in a movie once,

00:15:45.550 --> 00:15:48.420
where this couple flipped a coin to see if they could get married;

00:15:48.710 --> 00:15:50.050
if it came out heads they'd get married,

00:15:50.050 --> 00:15:51.880
and if it was tails they couldn't.

00:15:52.170 --> 00:15:52.880
How did it turn out?

00:15:53.050 --> 00:15:54.050
They got married, of course!

00:15:54.050 --> 00:15:55.550
It came out heads...

00:15:56.200 --> 00:15:57.200
Should we try it too?

00:15:57.200 --> 00:15:59.770
I bet we'll get heads for sure.

00:15:59.890 --> 00:16:00.680
Here!

00:16:03.810 --> 00:16:05.600
You didn't watch that movie very carefully, did you?

00:16:06.060 --> 00:16:06.860
In the movie,{timing check}

00:16:08.190 --> 00:16:09.870
the guy stuck two coins together like this,{timing check}

00:16:09.870 --> 00:16:11.440
so that it'd always come out heads.{timing check}

00:16:11.690 --> 00:16:15.660
And so, the loving couple got married and lived happily ever after.

00:16:28.750 --> 00:16:30.090
Apparently,

00:16:30.380 --> 00:16:34.130
there was this woman that my mom admired a long time ago.

00:16:34.380 --> 00:16:37.050
She was very pretty, and very talented.

00:16:37.300 --> 00:16:40.810
But apparently she made my mom miserable

00:16:40.810 --> 00:16:42.560
because she loved my dad so much.

00:16:45.140 --> 00:16:46.560
And that person is your mother.

00:16:46.940 --> 00:16:47.730
What?

00:16:48.900 --> 00:16:53.780
Apparently, my dad and your mother were once engaged.

00:16:56.490 --> 00:16:58.490
<i>Who's my father?</i>

00:16:58.660 --> 00:17:00.200
<i>He hurt me.</i>

00:17:01.240 --> 00:17:03.910
<i>He abandoned and chose to forget me.</i>

00:17:04.160 --> 00:17:06.250
<i>And then he died.</i>

00:17:25.430 --> 00:17:29.100
Are you really Joonsang?

00:17:29.810 --> 00:17:32.110
Yes, I am.

00:17:36.280 --> 00:17:37.450
I'm sorry.

00:17:37.860 --> 00:17:39.700
So you said you had a question for me?

00:17:39.700 --> 00:17:40.410
Go ahead.

00:17:41.280 --> 00:17:43.400
You told me back at the ski resort,

00:17:43.400 --> 00:17:46.200
that I came to see you here before the accident, didn't you?

00:17:46.460 --> 00:17:47.920
I did indeed.

00:17:49.120 --> 00:17:52.630
Did I ask you about my father back then?

00:17:53.630 --> 00:17:55.420
About your father?

00:17:56.380 --> 00:17:59.680
Do you know who my father is?

00:18:00.470 --> 00:18:03.470
Did your mother not tell you?

00:18:03.930 --> 00:18:06.700
She doesn't want to tell me, it seems.

00:18:06.700 --> 00:18:07.940
I think he passed away.

00:18:12.940 --> 00:18:14.780
The faculty meeting's about to start;

00:18:14.780 --> 00:18:16.440
everyone's waiting.

00:18:17.570 --> 00:18:19.900
Could you wait here for just a moment?

00:18:19.900 --> 00:18:22.410
I'll be right back.

00:18:38.920 --> 00:18:41.050
<i>The woman on Daddy's right is pretty, isn't she?</i>

00:18:41.340 --> 00:18:43.890
<i>Maybe he used to go out with her before marrying my mom.</i>

00:18:45.850 --> 00:18:47.550
<i>We were friends, yes.</i>

00:18:47.550 --> 00:18:49.270
<i>I did like Mi Hee,</i>

00:18:49.520 --> 00:18:51.900
<i>but it was Hyeonsoo that she liked.</i>

00:18:52.150 --> 00:18:53.480
<i>Ever since the start.</i>

00:18:54.210 --> 00:18:57.530
<i>He was someone I had loved ever since I was a little girl.</i>

00:18:57.780 --> 00:19:02.360
<i>If I told you that he's the only person I ever loved in my entire life</i>

00:19:03.030 --> 00:19:04.320
<i>would you believe me?</i>

00:19:13.630 --> 00:19:16.460
Is Hyeonsoo Jung my father?

00:19:18.880 --> 00:19:22.880
Is Yujin's father my father?

00:19:23.590 --> 00:19:24.550
Is he?

00:19:28.470 --> 00:19:30.890
I'm sorry, Joonsang.

00:19:45.740 --> 00:19:48.760
There are those in need of our kindness.

00:19:49.660 --> 00:19:51.790
Let's help our less fortunate neighbors.

00:20:25.820 --> 00:20:27.950
This should do in terms of the finishing materials.

00:20:33.790 --> 00:20:34.750
Man.

00:20:37.580 --> 00:20:39.520
This building's pretty much wrapped up,

00:20:39.520 --> 00:20:41.460
and we should be done with the renovations by the deadline

00:20:41.590 --> 00:20:43.800
if we concentrate on the villa's interior from here on out, right?

00:20:44.470 --> 00:20:45.400
Huh?

00:20:45.400 --> 00:20:46.970
Geez, this girl.

00:20:47.890 --> 00:20:51.000
This building has bad reception, remember?

00:20:51.000 --> 00:20:52.770
Why don't you call him outside after work?

00:20:52.890 --> 00:20:53.980
Oh, really?

00:20:54.430 --> 00:20:55.850
Okay, Jeong-a.

00:20:57.440 --> 00:20:58.650
Anything from Mr. Minhyung, yet?

00:21:00.130 --> 00:21:01.300
Nope.

00:21:01.300 --> 00:21:02.480
Whatever then.

00:21:03.650 --> 00:21:05.450
I talked to Seungryong just now,

00:21:05.570 --> 00:21:09.490
and apparently the electrical wiring in sector C is going to take some work.

00:21:16.160 --> 00:21:17.960
Cheers!

00:21:22.800 --> 00:21:24.170
How refreshing.{timing check}

00:21:24.340 --> 00:21:25.240
Sure is.{timing check}

00:21:25.240 --> 00:21:28.130
There's nothing better than a cold one after work.{timing check}

00:21:27.240 --> 00:21:28.130
So true.{timing check}

00:21:28.340 --> 00:21:29.840
Thanks for all your hard work, Ms. Jeong-a.{timing check}

00:21:30.010 --> 00:21:31.470
You too, Deputy Manager Kim.{timing check}

00:21:31.600 --> 00:21:32.720
Aw, shucks.

00:21:47.990 --> 00:21:51.910
Damn you, at least tell me if you're going somewhere!

00:21:52.490 --> 00:21:53.700
You bastard,

00:21:53.700 --> 00:21:55.910
why are you doing this to me?

00:22:21.350 --> 00:22:22.360
Joonsang.

00:22:29.900 --> 00:22:30.910
When did you get here?

00:22:31.870 --> 00:22:32.780
Just now.

00:22:33.070 --> 00:22:34.660
What took you so long?

00:22:35.030 --> 00:22:36.910
Do you know how long I was waiting for you?

00:22:37.540 --> 00:22:39.910
I was so worried.

00:22:40.580 --> 00:22:42.000
You didn't even pick up your phone;

00:22:42.000 --> 00:22:43.330
where have you been?

00:22:44.540 --> 00:22:46.430
What were you doing?

00:22:46.430 --> 00:22:47.960
What happened to you? {literal tl: why do you look like this}

00:22:49.260 --> 00:22:52.140
The snow here hasn't melted at all, has it?

00:22:53.260 --> 00:22:54.140
You...

00:22:57.930 --> 00:22:59.180
There's something wrong with you.

00:22:59.180 --> 00:23:00.810
Did something happen?

00:23:01.560 --> 00:23:02.440
No.

00:23:03.020 --> 00:23:04.730
Then what is it?

00:23:05.900 --> 00:23:07.280
It's too cold here.

00:23:07.780 --> 00:23:08.900
Dummy.

00:23:08.900 --> 00:23:10.400
I was so worried about you.

00:23:12.240 --> 00:23:13.110
I'm sorry.

00:23:19.910 --> 00:23:22.330
Yujin, let's...

00:23:23.540 --> 00:23:24.500
get married.
